<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="craf_paint_batch_view_form_stiker" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">craf.paint.batch.form.stiker</field>
        <field name="model">craf.paint.batch</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="craf_paint.craf_paint_batch_view_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//page[@name='chem']" position="before">
                <page string="Stiker" name="sticker">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert" invisible="state != 'draft' or not sticker_missing">
                        <i class="fa fa-exclamation-triangle me-1" title="Ogohlantirish"/>Stiker normasi yo'q kesimlar:
                        <field name="sticker_missing" class="oe_inline"/> — ularga stiker yechilmaydi
                        (Stiker → Profil normalari).
                    </div>
                    <group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="sticker_logo_id" readonly="state != 'draft'" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                        </group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="sticker_rolls"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>
                    <div class="text-muted small mb-2" invisible="state != 'draft'">
                        Tasdiqlanganda stiker o'zi hisoblanadi: bo'yalgan dona × uzunlik × tomonlar (profil normasi);
                        yopishqoqlik rang bo'yicha. «Sarf» ni o'zgartirsangiz — qo'lda yozilgani qoladi.
                        <button name="action_fill_stickers" type="object" string="Hisoblash" icon="fa-calculator"
                                class="btn-link p-0 ms-1"/>
                    </div>
                    <field name="sticker_line_ids" readonly="state != 'draft'">
                        <list editable="bottom">
                            <field name="sticker_id" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="meters_norm" sum="Jami"/>
                            <field name="meters" sum="Jami"/>
                            <field name="rolls" sum="Jami"/>
                        </list>
                        <kanban class="o_kanban_mobile">
                            <templates>
                                <t t-name="card">
                                    <field name="sticker_id" class="fw-bold"/>
                                    <div class="d-flex mt-1">
                                        <span class="text-muted">norma <field name="meters_norm"/> m</span>
                                        <span class="ms-auto"><field name="meters" class="fw-bold"/> m ·
                                            <field name="rolls"/> rulon</span>
                                    </div>
                                </t>
                            </templates>
                        </kanban>
                    </field>
                </page>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
